  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 65,
      "at": [
        -28,
        -24
      ],
      "text": "Two 555 timers. Left, astable: C charges through 10k + 68k and discharges through 68k between 1/3 and 2/3\nof 9 V, so the red LED blinks at 1.44 / ((RA + 2 RB) C) = about 1 Hz; the scope shows OUT and the capacitor.\nRight, monostable: press SW1 and the green LED stays on for 1.1 R C = 1.1 s, however short the press."
    }
  ]
